        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Saint Paul School of Theology, United Methodist Church, United Methodist Church of the Resurrection\n- Places: Overland Park, Kansas; Kansas City metropolitan area; Leawood, Kansas; Olathe, Kansas; Kansas City, Missouri; Blue Springs, Missouri\n- People: Nancy R. Howell, Woodie W. White\n- Roles: Professor of Theology and Philosophy of Religion, Bishop\n\nFacts:\n- Woodie W. White was born in 1935.\n- Woodie W. White is an American bishop of the United Methodist Church who was elected in 1984.\n- Saint Paul School of Theology is a United Methodist seminary in Overland Park, Kansas, in the Kansas City metropolitan area.\n- Saint Paul School of Theology is one of 13 seminaries of the United Methodist Church.\n- Nancy R. Howell is Professor of Theology and Philosophy of Religion at Saint Paul School of Theology in Kansas City, Missouri.\n- The original campus of the United Methodist Church of the Resurrection is in Leawood, Kansas.\n- The United Methodist Church of the Resurrection has additional locations in Olathe, Kansas, downtown Kansas City, Missouri, and Blue Springs, Missouri.",
